{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/promo_press.png?t=1748453691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The latest sensation to hit Gensokyo, Volleyball! But this isn't an ordinary game of volleyball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The skies are your court as you will pick a team of two of your favorite Touhou characters. They will not only attempt to keep the ball in play but also avoid the bullets coming your way, all while dishing out your own attacks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1748453691\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day in Gensokyo, everyone woke up to find their powers absent, including our resident incident solvers, Reimu and Marisa. But when Sakuya suddenly appears before them, a great revelation is made. A strange orb has appeared in Gensokyo with the power to take away abilities and grant them as it sees fit. Our heroines are on another case, going from place to place, challenging their friends in this new sport that has taken Gensokyo by storm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a 2D arcade style sports game with 8 way movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First to reach match point or have the most points by time out is declared the winner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dash button allows you to streak across the screen and focus allows you to slow down\u00a0 to a crawl for careful placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ball button allows you to hit the ball in various ways depending on how and when you press it along with direction buttons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack your opponent with projectiles, bombs, and a powerful desperation move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/gif_1.gif?t=1748453691\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players can play 2v2 in local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player modes such as story campaign and mini games waiting to be unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Practice and tutorial mode to get a grasp of the intricate mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A partner edit system where you can customize your CPU teammate from a list of commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support and up to two players on keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base roster of 14 of your favorite Touhou characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/promo_renu.png?t=1748453691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428330?t=1748453691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428330?t=1748453691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/255d6ca205115d8ff006ae0a56786e35f5a33c61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748453691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/255d6ca205115d8ff006ae0a56786e35f5a33c61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748453691","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos"