, bombs, and a powerful desperation move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/gif_1.gif?t=1748453691\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players can play 2v2 in local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player modes such as story campaign and mini games waiting to be unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Practice and tutorial mode to get a grasp of the intricate mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A partner edit system where you can customize your CPU teammate from a list of commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support and up to two players on keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base roster of 14 of your favorite Touhou characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/extras/promo_renu.png?t=1748453691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Compact TH"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428330/f05da0914d2221b448d813d77dbda07febb94cb3/header.jpg?t=1748453691","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This is a fan-made game of the Touhou Project which is not affiliated, endorsed, or associated with Zun. This derivative work follows the Touhou Project Fan Works Guidelines.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll rights to characters, settings, and themes based on the Touhou Project are property of Team Shanghai Alice.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257085759,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085759/movie480.mp4?t=1736882136","max":"http://video.akama